{"seq":1,"slug":"terrain-texture-splatting","title":"地形纹理混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/shading/terrain-texture-splatting","wordCount":1469,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"地形纹理混合\">地形纹理混合</h1><p>一片地形从来不是单一材质：山顶是积雪、山坡是裸岩、坡脚是草地、河床是砂砾，而且它们之间没有清晰的边界，是互相渗透过渡的。普通模型给每个面贴一张固定贴图就行，地形却要在同一片连续表面上无缝混合几十种地表材质，还要让混合随坡度、海拔自然变化。纹理混合（splatting）就是干这件事的——用一张权重图在多层材质间加权，再用若干技巧让接缝看不出来。这一篇讲清权重混合的机制与让它逼真的关键手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-权重图驱动的多层加权\">核心概念：权重图驱动的多层加权</h2><p>纹理混合的核心是一张 <strong>splat map（权重图）</strong>：与地形对齐的一张纹理，每个像素的 RGBA 四个通道分别存四层材质在该处的权重。渲染时对每层材质各采样一次 albedo/法线/粗糙度，再按权重加权求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{final}} = \\frac{\\sum_{i} w_i \\, c_i}{\\sum_{i} w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四个通道只够四层，更多层就用多张 splat map。权重图既可由美术手绘（在哪刷什么材质），也可由规则程序化生成——陡坡自动给岩石层加权、高海拔给雪层加权、平地给草层加权，这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/heightmaps-representation\">基础</a> 章算出的坡度与海拔派生量的主要消费者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[splat map RGBA&lt;br/&gt;每通道一层权重] --&gt; B[逐层采样&lt;br/&gt;albedo/法线/粗糙度]&#10;    C[坡度/海拔/噪声&lt;br/&gt;程序化权重] --&gt; A&#10;    D[美术手绘笔刷] --&gt; A&#10;    B --&gt; E{混合方式}&#10;    E --&gt;|线性| F[按权重加权平均]&#10;    E --&gt;|高度混合| G[按材质高度图&lt;br/&gt;取胜者主导]&#10;    F --&gt; H[过渡软 但发灰]&#10;    G --&gt; I[过渡锐利 自然咬合]&#10;    H --&gt; J[光照着色输出]&#10;    I --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    A[splat map RGBA&lt;br/&gt;每通道一层权重] --&gt; B[逐层采样&lt;br/&gt;albedo/法线/粗糙度]\n    C[坡度/海拔/噪声&lt;br/&gt;程序化权重] --&gt; A\n    D[美术手绘笔刷] --&gt; A\n    B --&gt; E{混合方式}\n    E --&gt;|线性| F[按权重加权平均]\n    E --&gt;|高度混合| G[按材质高度图&lt;br/&gt;取胜者主导]\n    F --&gt; H[过渡软 但发灰]\n    G --&gt; I[过渡锐利 自然咬合]\n    H --&gt; J[光照着色输出]\n    I --&gt; J</pre><p>下表对比几种混合方式的取舍，它们决定接缝看起来&quot;糊&quot;还是&quot;真&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>混合方式</th>\n<th>过渡观感</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性加权</td>\n<td>软、易发灰</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>默认、远景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度混合（height blend）</td>\n<td>锐利、咬合自然</td>\n<td>中（每层多一张高度图）</td>\n<td>近景主材质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三平面映射</td>\n<td>解决陡坡拉伸</td>\n<td>高（采样×3）</td>\n<td>悬崖、岩壁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>距离混合（detail tiling）</td>\n<td>抑制近距瓷砖感</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大面积同材质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"高度混合-让砂砾真正卡进石缝\">高度混合：让砂砾真正卡进石缝</h2><p>朴素线性加权有个挥之不去的毛病：两层材质交界处是两者按比例的均值，看起来像被均匀涂抹的灰泥，没有真实地表那种&quot;砂砾填进岩石凹陷、岩石凸起露在砂砾之上&quot;的咬合感。<strong>高度混合</strong>给每层材质额外配一张高度图，混合时不取均值，而是让&quot;权重 + 材质局部高度&quot;之和更大的那一层在该像素胜出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>uv</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i&#x27; = w_i + h_i(\\text{uv}) \\cdot k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">uv</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>然后在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0106em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的峰值附近做一个窄过渡。效果是过渡带沿着材质本身的高低起伏蜿蜒——草会先长进岩石的低洼处，碎石嵌在石缝里，过渡锐利而自然。这是近景地表逼真度的关键一招，代价是每层多采一张高度图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三平面映射-陡坡不再被拉成面条\">三平面映射：陡坡不再被拉成面条</h2><p>地形材质通常按俯视的平面 UV（直接用世界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">xz</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>）平铺，这在平地很好，但在接近垂直的悬崖上灾难性地失效——平面 UV 在竖直面上被极度拉伸，纹理变成一条条&quot;面条&quot;。**三平面映射（triplanar）**用三组投影解决：分别从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 三个轴向把纹理投影到表面，再按表面法线在三个朝向上的分量加权混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{b} = \\frac{|\\vec{n}|^p}{\\sum |\\vec{n}_{xyz}|^p}, \\quad c = b_x c_{yz} + b_y c_{xz} + b_z c_{xy}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH21